{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-testing-fuzzing","title":"动态测试与模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/dynamic-testing-fuzzing","wordCount":611,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态测试与模糊测试\">动态测试与模糊测试</h1><p>静态分析检查代码结构，动态测试则让代码真正运行——用大量随机或半随机输入轰击合约，观察是否出现违反预期的行为。在智能合约安全领域，模糊测试（Fuzzing）和不变式测试（Invariant Testing）已经成为发现复杂状态依赖漏洞的核心手段。Foundry 的内置 fuzzer 和 Trail of Bits 的 Echidna 是当前两大主流工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模糊测试的核心思想是：<strong>定义&quot;什么是正确的&quot;（不变式），然后用海量随机输入试图找到违反不变式的路径。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    DEFINE[定义不变式/属性] --&gt; GENERATE[生成随机输入]&#10;    GENERATE --&gt; EXECUTE[执行交易序列]&#10;    EXECUTE --&gt; CHECK{检查不变式}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|违反| SHRINK[最小化反例]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|通过| MUTATE[变异输入]&#10;    SHRINK --&gt; REPORT[输出最小违反序列]&#10;    MUTATE --&gt; EXECUTE&#10;    GENERATE -.-&gt;|覆盖率引导| CORPUS[语料库]&#10;    CORPUS -.-&gt;|种子| GENERATE\">flowchart TB\n    DEFINE[定义不变式/属性] --&gt; GENERATE[生成随机输入]\n    GENERATE --&gt; EXECUTE[执行交易序列]\n    EXECUTE --&gt; CHECK{检查不变式}\n    CHECK --&gt;|违反| SHRINK[最小化反例]\n    CHECK --&gt;|通过| MUTATE[变异输入]\n    SHRINK --&gt; REPORT[输出最小违反序列]\n    MUTATE --&gt; EXECUTE\n    GENERATE -.-&gt;|覆盖率引导| CORPUS[语料库]\n    CORPUS -.-&gt;|种子| GENERATE</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>开发者</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>核心特性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Foundry Fuzz</td>\n<td>Paradigm</td>\n<td>Solidity测试</td>\n<td>速度快、Solidity原生、property-based</td>\n<td>单函数属性测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Foundry Invariant</td>\n<td>Paradigm</td>\n<td>Solidity测试</td>\n<td>多合约状态空间探索</td>\n<td>协议级不变式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Echidna</td>\n<td>Trail of Bits</td>\n<td>Haskell引擎</td>\n<td>覆盖率引导、高级收缩</td>\n<td>复杂状态机协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Medusa</td>\n<td>Trail of Bits</td>\n<td>Go引擎</td>\n<td>Echidna精神继承、并行化</td>\n<td>大规模并行模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Halmos</td>\n<td>a]16z</td>\n<td>Python/Z3</td>\n<td>符号化模糊（bounded model checking）</td>\n<td>数学属性验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"foundry-模糊测试实战\">Foundry 模糊测试实战</h2><p>Foundry 的 <code>forge test</code> 内置了 property-based fuzzing：任何测试函数只要接受参数，就会被自动模糊化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 属性测试：验证质押/取款不会凭空创造代币&#10;contract VaultFuzzTest is Test {&#10;    SecureVault vault;&#10;    MockERC20 token;&#10;&#10;    function setUp() public {&#10;        token = new MockERC20(&quot;Test&quot;, &quot;TST&quot;, 18);&#10;        vault = new SecureVault(address(token));&#10;        token.mint(address(this), 1000000e18);&#10;        token.approve(address(vault), type(uint256).max);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // Foundry 自动为 amount 生成随机值&#10;    function testFuzz_stakeWithdrawConservation(uint256 amount) public {&#10;        // 限制输入范围到有意义的区间&#10;        amount = bound(amount, 1, token.balanceOf(address(this)));&#10;&#10;        uint256 balanceBefore = token.balanceOf(address(this));&#10;&#10;        vault.stake(amount);&#10;        vault.withdraw(amount);&#10;&#10;        uint256 balanceAfter = token.balanceOf(address(this));&#10;&#10;        // 不变式：质押再取款后余额不变&#10;        assertEq(balanceAfter, balanceBefore, &quot;Token conservation violated&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 模糊多个参数&#10;    function testFuzz_noFreeTokens(&#10;        uint256 stakeAmount,&#10;        uint256 withdrawAmount&#10;    ) public {&#10;        stakeAmount = bound(stakeAmount, 1, token.balanceOf(address(this)));&#10;        vault.stake(stakeAmount);&#10;&#10;        // 不变式：不能取出超过质押的量&#10;        if (withdrawAmount &gt; stakeAmount) {&#10;            vm.expectRevert();&#10;        }&#10;        vault.withdraw(withdrawAmount);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 属性测试：验证质押/取款不会凭空创造代币</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VaultFuzzTest is Test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SecureVault vault;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    MockERC20 token;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function setUp() public {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        token = new MockERC20(\"Test\", \"TST\", 18);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault = new SecureVault(address(token));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        token.mint(address(this), 1000000e18);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        token.approve(address(vault), type(uint256).max);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Foundry 自动为 amount 生成随机值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function testFuzz_stakeWithdrawConservation(uint256 amount) public {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 限制输入范围到有意义的区间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        amount = bound(amount, 1, token.balanceOf(address(this)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 balanceBefore = token.balanceOf(address(this));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault.stake(amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault.withdraw(amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 balanceAfter = token.balanceOf(address(this));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 不变式：质押再取款后余额不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEq(balanceAfter, balanceBefore, \"Token conservation violated\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 模糊多个参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function testFuzz_noFreeTokens(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 stakeAmount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 withdrawAmount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) public {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stakeAmount = bound(stakeAmount, 1, token.balanceOf(address(this)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault.stake(stakeAmount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 不变式：不能取出超过质押的量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (withdrawAmount > stakeAmount) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            vm.expectRevert();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault.withdraw(withdrawAmount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置 Foundry 的 fuzzing 参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# foundry.toml&#10;[fuzz]&#10;runs = 10000            # 每个模糊测试运行 10000 次&#10;max_test_rejects = 100000&#10;seed = &#39;0x1234&#39;         # 固定种子以便复现&#10;dictionary_weight = 40  # 40% 输入来自字典（合约中的常量）&#10;&#10;[invariant]&#10;runs = 256              # 不变式测试运行 256 轮&#10;depth = 100             # 每轮最多 100 个调用&#10;fail_on_revert = false  # revert 不算违规（只看断言）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># foundry.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[fuzz]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>runs = 10000            # 每个模糊测试运行 10000 次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max_test_rejects = 100000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>seed = '0x1234'         # 固定种子以便复现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dictionary_weight = 40  # 40% 输入来自字典（合约中的常量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[invariant]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>runs = 256              # 不变式测试运行 256 轮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>depth = 100             # 每轮最多 100 个调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fail_on_revert = false  # revert 不算违规（只看断言）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"不变式测试-协议级安全验证\">不变式测试：协议级安全验证</h2><p>不变式测试超越单函数属性，探索整个协议在任意调用序列下是否维持核心安全属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 不变式测试：验证借贷协议的偿付能力&#10;contract LendingInvariantTest is Test {&#10;    LendingPool pool;&#10;    Handler handler; // 封装所有可能的用户操作&#10;&#10;    function setUp() public {&#10;        pool = new LendingPool();&#10;        handler = new Handler(pool);&#10;&#10;        // 告诉 Foundry 只调用 handler 的函数&#10;        targetContract(address(handler));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 核心不变式：总抵押品价值 &gt;= 总债务&#10;    function invariant_solvency() public view {&#10;        uint256 totalCollateral = pool.totalCollateralValue();&#10;        uint256 totalDebt = pool.totalDebtValue();&#10;        assertGe(totalCollateral, totalDebt, &quot;Protocol insolvent!&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 不变式：代币总量守恒&#10;    function invariant_tokenConservation() public view {&#10;        uint256 poolBalance = token.balanceOf(address(pool));&#10;        uint256 totalDeposited = pool.totalDeposited();&#10;        uint256 totalBorrowed = pool.totalBorrowed();&#10;        assertEq(poolBalance, totalDeposited - totalBorrowed);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Handler：封装用户操作并维护 ghost 变量&#10;contract Handler is Test {&#10;    LendingPool pool;&#10;    uint256 public ghost_totalDeposited;&#10;&#10;    function deposit(uint256 amount) external {&#10;        amount = bound(amount, 1, 100e18);&#10;        deal(address(token), msg.sender, amount);&#10;        vm.prank(msg.sender);&#10;        pool.deposit(amount);&#10;        ghost_totalDeposited += amount;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function borrow(uint256 amount) external {&#10;        amount = bound(amount, 1, pool.maxBorrowable(msg.sender));&#10;        vm.prank(msg.sender);&#10;        pool.borrow(amount);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 不变式测试：验证借贷协议的偿付能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract LendingInvariantTest is Test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LendingPool pool;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Handler handler; // 封装所有可能的用户操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function setUp() public {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pool = new LendingPool();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handler = new Handler(pool);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 告诉 Foundry 只调用 handler 的函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetContract(address(handler));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 核心不变式：总抵押品价值 >= 总债务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function invariant_solvency() public view {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 totalCollateral = pool.totalCollateralValue();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 totalDebt = pool.totalDebtValue();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertGe(totalCollateral, totalDebt, \"Protocol insolvent!\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 不变式：代币总量守恒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function invariant_tokenConservation() public view {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 poolBalance = token.balanceOf(address(pool));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 totalDeposited = pool.totalDeposited();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 totalBorrowed = pool.totalBorrowed();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEq(poolBalance, totalDeposited - totalBorrowed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Handler：封装用户操作并维护 ghost 变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract Handler is Test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LendingPool pool;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public ghost_totalDeposited;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function deposit(uint256 amount) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        amount = bound(amount, 1, 100e18);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        deal(address(token), msg.sender, amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vm.prank(msg.sender);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pool.deposit(amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ghost_totalDeposited += amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function borrow(uint256 amount) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        amount = bound(amount, 1, pool.maxBorrowable(msg.sender));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vm.prank(msg.sender);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pool.borrow(amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"echidna-覆盖率引导模糊\">Echidna 覆盖率引导模糊</h2><p>Echidna 使用覆盖率反馈来引导输入生成，倾向于探索新的代码路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// Echidna 属性函数以 echidna_ 前缀命名&#10;contract EchidnaVaultTest {&#10;    SecureVault vault;&#10;&#10;    constructor() {&#10;        vault = new SecureVault();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 属性：用户余额之和不超过合约持有的总代币&#10;    function echidna_balance_invariant() public view returns (bool) {&#10;        return vault.totalStaked() &lt;= token.balanceOf(address(vault));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 属性：暂停状态下不能执行质押&#10;    function echidna_paused_no_stake() public returns (bool) {&#10;        if (vault.paused()) {&#10;            try vault.stake(1) {&#10;                return false; // 不应成功&#10;            } catch {&#10;                return true; // 正确 revert&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return true;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Echidna 属性函数以 echidna_ 前缀命名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract EchidnaVaultTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SecureVault vault;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    constructor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vault = new SecureVault();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 属性：用户余额之和不超过合约持有的总代币</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function echidna_balance_invariant() public view returns (bool) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return vault.totalStaked() &#x3C;= token.balanceOf(address(vault));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 属性：暂停状态下不能执行质押</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function echidna_paused_no_stake() public returns (bool) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (vault.paused()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            try vault.stake(1) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return false; // 不应成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            } catch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return true; // 正确 revert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# echidna.config.yaml&#10;testMode: assertion&#10;testLimit: 50000&#10;seqLen: 100&#10;corpusDir: corpus&#10;coverage: true&#10;cryticArgs: [&#39;--solc-remaps&#39;, &#39;@openzeppelin=node_modules/@openzeppelin&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># echidna.config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">testMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">assertion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">testLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">seqLen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">corpusDir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">corpus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">coverage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cryticArgs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--solc-remaps'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@openzeppelin=node_modules/@openzeppelin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"halmos-符号化模糊测试\">Halmos：符号化模糊测试</h2><p>Halmos 将符号执行与 Foundry 测试框架结合，对有界状态空间进行穷举验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// Halmos 测试：用符号变量穷举所有可能输入&#10;function check_withdrawNeverExceedsBalance(&#10;    uint256 depositAmt,&#10;    uint256 withdrawAmt&#10;) public {&#10;    // Halmos 用符号值而非随机值&#10;    vm.assume(depositAmt &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; depositAmt &lt;= type(uint128).max);&#10;&#10;    vault.deposit(depositAmt);&#10;&#10;    if (withdrawAmt &gt; depositAmt) {&#10;        // 证明：超额取款必然 revert&#10;        vm.expectRevert();&#10;    }&#10;    vault.withdraw(withdrawAmt);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Halmos 测试：用符号变量穷举所有可能输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function check_withdrawNeverExceedsBalance(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 depositAmt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 withdrawAmt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) public {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Halmos 用符号值而非随机值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vm.assume(depositAmt > 0 &#x26;&#x26; depositAmt &#x3C;= type(uint128).max);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vault.deposit(depositAmt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (withdrawAmt > depositAmt) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 证明：超额取款必然 revert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vm.expectRevert();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vault.withdraw(withdrawAmt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 运行 Halmos&#10;halmos --contract VaultTest --function check_ --loop 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行 Halmos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">halmos</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --contract</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> VaultTest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --function</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --loop</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Halmos 与传统 fuzzing 的区别在于：fuzzing 是&quot;尽力找反例&quot;，Halmos 是&quot;在有界范围内证明不存在反例&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>模糊测试通过定义不变式 + 随机输入发现复杂状态漏洞</li>\n<li>Foundry fuzz 速度最快、与开发流程零摩擦</li>\n<li>不变式测试探索多调用序列下的协议级安全属性</li>\n<li>Echidna 的覆盖率引导能更高效地探索深层状态空间</li>\n<li>Halmos 提供有界范围内的穷举验证，介于 fuzzing 和完整形式化验证之间</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"formal-verification\">形式化验证</a>——从数学层面证明合约正确性</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../financial-risk-management/regulation-stress-testing/stress-testing-scenarios\">金融风险管理：压力测试</a>——压力测试方法论的跨领域借鉴</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态测试与模糊测试","id":"动态测试与模糊测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Foundry 模糊测试实战","id":"foundry-模糊测试实战"},{"level":2,"text":"不变式测试：协议级安全验证","id":"不变式测试-协议级安全验证"},{"level":2,"text":"Echidna 覆盖率引导模糊","id":"echidna-覆盖率引导模糊"},{"level":2,"text":"Halmos：符号化模糊测试","id":"halmos-符号化模糊测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"静态分析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/static-analysis-tools"},"next":{"title":"形式化验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/auditing/formal-verification"}}